   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules for Day 30\n• the Day 0 assessment is never edited; a new assessment is compared with it\n• bookings are not dollars: never converted into a GBV estimate\n• proposals are always \"evidence-based overrides\", at most one tier up\n• 30 days may not represent a year · missing activity ≠ zero travel",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
